<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Nastech started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Nastech started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Patricia Bank said she started coverage of Nastech Pharmaceuticals Co with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the concern, which has a nasal drug delivery technology, were unchanged at 8-5/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;NSTK is an emerging growth story with a validated technology,&quot; Bank said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
